flowchart TD
    LOGOUT[logout] --> REVOKE{server revoke}
    REVOKE -->|ok or offline| CLEAR[clear all session-scoped stores]
    CLEAR --> WIPE[wipe tokens/keys]
    WIPE --> STATE[SessionState = Unauthenticated]
    STATE --> NAV[nav -> Login, ViewModels destroyed]
    REVOKE -.->|offline| LATER[token unusable after short TTL anyway Ch 19]
